  "body": "Follow-up from the review of PR #3142 (#3100), comment 7061343567.\n\n1. No test sends a cross drill through `posed_kind` (`crates/app/src/operation/first_traverse_posed.rs`).\n2. The unit test of `table_top` covers only the sphere case (two work-turning rotaries), not the case of one tilting rotary (a full turn about its line).\n3. No test proves the post refusal by name for this verdict alone, because the index-swing clause can refuse the post first.\n\nWork: add these three pins on test machines that are built inline.\n",
